      {
        "body": "Review and correct session refresh timing using the verified fifteen-minute access-token lifetime. The prior design's claim that refresh happens before expiry cannot be relied on until corrected and verified. No implementation fix has been recorded. The prior source also stated refresh tokens last thirty days; this separate figure has not been rechecked or contradicted by the new finding.",
